 kidnapped by someone.<br>It's a completely different island, a smuggling stopover for the South American Mafia.<br>Mafia's goal is to kidnap Juri for a ransom of $10 million.<br><br>Meanwhile, the Miami-Dade Police Department suspects Mia of being the kidnapper.<br><br>Will Mia and Juli be able to escape the mafia, get off the island, clear their suspicions, and make it to the music festival?", "short_description": "Pixel Art &amp; Yuri &amp; Cinema! The story of a Bad Girl in Miami and a JK from Tokyo. A Girl meets Girl Entertainment Crime Thriller.", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653990/header.jpg?t=1638693175", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1638693175", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1638693175", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Mojave (10.14)</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["hushpuppy"], "publishers": ["hushpuppy"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": true, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653990/ss_262d02d4f40f069a7b5b8b0df19475b769e3ecc1.600x338.jpg?t=1638693175", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1653990/ss_262d02d4f40f069a7b5b8b0df19475b769e3ecc1.19